@startuml Sequence Diagram - Adăugare Înregistrare Medicală

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

title Diagramă Secvență - Adăugare/Editare Înregistrare Medicală

actor "Medic" as Doctor
participant "Frontend\nAdmin Dashboard" as Frontend
participant "API Route\n/app/api/medical-records" as API
participant "Medical Record\nHelpers" as Helpers
database "SQLite\nDatabase" as Database

== Verificare Înregistrare Existentă ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Adaugă Consultație" pe programare
Frontend -> API: GET /api/medical-records/by-appointment/[appointmentId]
API -> Helpers: getByAppointmentId(appointmentId)
Helpers -> Database: SELECT * FROM medical_records\nWHERE appointmentId = ?
Database --> Helpers: medicalRecord (sau null)
Helpers --> API: MedicalRecord | null
API --> Frontend: MedicalRecord | null

alt Înregistrare există (Edit Mode)
  Frontend -> Frontend: Setează isEditMode = true
  Frontend -> Frontend: Pre-populează formular cu date existente
else Înregistrare nu există (Create Mode)
  Frontend -> Frontend: Setează isEditMode = false
  Frontend -> Frontend: Afișează formular gol
end

== Pasul 1: Consultație de Bază ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează chiefComplaint
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează subjectiveNotes
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează objectiveFindings
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează assessment
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează plan
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Următorul Pas"

== Pasul 2: Diagnosticuri ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Adaugă diagnostic
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează diagnosisName, diagnosisCode
Doctor -> Frontend: Selectează diagnosisType, status
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Adaugă Diagnostic"
Frontend -> Frontend: Adaugă diagnostic în listă locală
Doctor -> Frontend: Poate adăuga mai multe diagnosticuri
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Următorul Pas"

== Pasul 3: Rețete ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Adaugă rețetă
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează medicationName, dosage
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează frequency, route, quantity
Doctor -> Frontend: Selectează startDate, endDate
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează instructions, refills
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Adaugă Rețetă"
Frontend -> Frontend: Adaugă rețetă în listă locală
Doctor -> Frontend: Poate adăuga mai multe rețete
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Următorul Pas"

== Pasul 4: Semne Vitale ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează bloodPressure (systolic/diastolic)
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează pulse, temperature
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează oxygenSaturation, respiratoryRate
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează weight, height
Doctor -> Frontend: Completează glucoseLevel
Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Salvează Consultație"

== Salvare Înregistrare ==
alt Edit Mode
  Frontend -> API: PATCH /api/medical-records/[recordId]\n{chiefComplaint, subjectiveNotes,\nobjectiveFindings, assessment, plan}
  API -> Helpers: update(recordId, updates)
  Helpers -> Database: UPDATE medical_records\nSET ... WHERE id = ?
  Database --> Helpers: Success
  Helpers --> API: Updated record
else Create Mode
  Frontend -> API: POST /api/medical-records\n{patientId, appointmentId, doctorName,\nrecordType, visitDate, ...}
  API -> Helpers: create(medicalRecord)
  Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO medical_records
  Database --> Helpers: recordId
  Helpers --> API: Created record
end

== Salvare Diagnosticuri ==
loop Pentru fiecare diagnostic
  Frontend -> API: POST /api/medical-records/[recordId]/diagnoses\n{diagnosisName, diagnosisCode,\ndiagnosisType, status, notes}
  API -> Helpers: diagnosisHelpers.create(diagnosis)
  Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO diagnoses
  Database --> Helpers: diagnosisId
  Helpers --> API: Created diagnosis
end

== Salvare Rețete ==
loop Pentru fiecare rețetă
  Frontend -> API: POST /api/medical-records/[recordId]/prescriptions\n{medicationName, dosage, frequency,\nroute, quantity, startDate, ...}
  API -> Helpers: prescriptionHelpers.create(prescription)
  Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO prescriptions
  Database --> Helpers: prescriptionId
  Helpers --> API: Created prescription
end

== Salvare Semne Vitale ==
Frontend -> API: POST /api/medical-records/[recordId]/vital-signs\n{bloodPressureSystolic, bloodPressureDiastolic,\npulse, temperature, ...}
API -> Helpers: vitalSignsHelpers.create(vitalSigns)
Helpers -> Database: INSERT INTO vital_signs
Database --> Helpers: vitalSignsId
Helpers --> API: Created vital signs
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

Frontend -> Frontend: Închide modal
Frontend -> Frontend: Actualizează tabel programări
Frontend -> Doctor: Afișează confirmare salvare

@enduml
